# Netlify redirects. Copied verbatim into dist/ at build, the same single-source
# convention public/_headers uses.
#
# The boxed Freeze-Drying Packaging Starter Kit was archived in Shopify on
# 2026-09-09 when we stopped reselling PackFreshUSA's set. Its product page had
# inbound links, so the handle redirects to /shop rather than 404ing: a reader
# following an old link lands on the range that replaced it. 301, because the
# product is not coming back under this handle.
/shop/freeze-dryer-packaging-starter-kit    /shop    301
